stateDiagram-v2
  [*] --> Idle
  Idle --> SourceUp: start video-source
  SourceUp --> Starting: graph components start
  Starting --> Running: pipeline OK Started event
  Starting --> Error: port conflict or ingest fail
  Error --> Idle: clear port stop
  Running --> Running: ClientConnected ClientDisconnected
  Running --> Reconnecting: SourceLost
  Reconnecting --> Running: SourceRecovered
  Running --> AbrActive: ABR step down or up
  AbrActive --> Running: bitrate stable
  Running --> Stopped: graph components stop
  Stopped --> Idle: teardown
  Running --> Idle: daemon restart then re-arm
